      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "fontSize": 12,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "text": "Colors\n· Purple = mailbot-hermes\n· Green  = mailbot-api\n· Teal   = ollama\n· Blue   = SQLite tables\n· Red    = Router + Anthropic\n· Amber  = Privacy / auth gates\n\nLine styles\n— solid  = live-verified path\n· · dashed = scheduled / pull\n\nCapability families\n✓ F1 Outlook Sync\n✓ F2 Ingest Pipeline\n✓ F3 Router + Tiered LLM\n✓ F4 Conversational Control\n✓ F5 Authorized Actions\n✓ F6 Cost Governance\n✓ F7 Observability & Trust\n✗ F8 Eval & Calibration\n   (Epic 9 + Epic 7 backlog)\n\nFinal gate\n△ CP-1 VPS deploy (Hostinger)\n   — runs after Epic 7\n\nLive walks verified 2026-06-06\n· CP-A · CP-B · CP-C all PASS\n· 1140 tests + 4 gates green",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "baseline": 12,
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Colors\n· Purple = mailbot-hermes\n· Green  = mailbot-api\n· Teal   = ollama\n· Blue   = SQLite tables\n· Red    = Router + Anthropic\n· Amber  = Privacy / auth gates\n\nLine styles\n— solid  = live-verified path\n· · dashed = scheduled / pull\n\nCapability families\n✓ F1 Outlook Sync\n✓ F2 Ingest Pipeline\n✓ F3 Router + Tiered LLM\n✓ F4 Conversational Control\n✓ F5 Authorized Actions\n✓ F6 Cost Governance\n✓ F7 Observability & Trust\n✗ F8 Eval & Calibration\n   (Epic 9 + Epic 7 backlog)\n\nFinal gate\n△ CP-1 VPS deploy (Hostinger)\n   — runs after Epic 7\n\nLive walks verified 2026-06-06\n· CP-A · CP-B · CP-C all PASS\n· 1140 tests + 4 gates green",
